{
  "id": "JOB.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "reference": "Job 4",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Eliphaz the Temanite answered and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "If",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.4.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.4.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "we assay to commune with thee, wilt thou be grieved? but who can withhold himself from speaking?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, thou hast instructed many, and thou hast strengthened the weak hands.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy words have upholden him that was falling, and thou hast strengthened the feeble knees.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But now it is come upon thee, and thou faintest; it toucheth thee, and thou art troubled.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.4.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.4.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "this",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.4.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.4.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy fear, thy confidence, thy hope, and the uprightness of thy ways?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember, I pray thee, who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "ever",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.4.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.4.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "perished, being innocent? or where were the righteous cut off?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even as I have seen, they that plow iniquity, and sow wickedness, reap the same.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By the blast of God they perish, and by the breath of his nostrils are they consumed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The roaring of the lion, and the voice of the fierce lion, and the teeth of the young lions, are broken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The old lion perisheth for lack of prey, and the stout lion's whelps are scattered abroad.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now a thing was secretly brought to me, and mine ear received a little thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In thoughts from the visions of the night, when deep sleep falleth on men,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fear came upon me, and trembling, which made all my bones to shake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then a spirit passed before my face; the hair of my flesh stood up:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It stood still, but I could not discern the form thereof: an image",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.4.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.4.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "before mine eyes,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.4.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.4.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "silence, and I heard a voice,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "saying",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.4.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.4.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shall mortal man be more just than God? shall a man be more pure than his maker?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, he put no trust in his servants; and his angels he charged with folly:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How much less",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "in",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.4.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.4.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "them that dwell in houses of clay, whose foundation",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.4.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.4.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the dust,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.4.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.4.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "are crushed before the moth?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They are destroyed from morning to evening: they perish for ever without any regarding",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.4.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.4.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doth not their excellency",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.4.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.4.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in them go away? they die, even without wisdom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.4.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "JOB.5",
    "number": "5",
